I don't know if this is just the peculiarities of a youthful mind at
work, but upon closer inspection, the proffered logo appears vaguely
sexual.

This probably isn't the intention at all. Maybe from a different angle...

Anyway, I don't know if what I've attached is any better or lighter or
anything--all I did was a superficial pass through Photoshop,
substituted some colors, adjusted others--I like this 3-d idea and the
perspective and all, but it seems the rendering could be done a bit
more subtly, and the resolution made better. (I'd do it myself, but
for a lack of rendering software... and, probably, computing
resources. Damned old behemoth of a box.)

mi'e .noras.

